PHON","Unknown Logger"]', '["CVE-2017-8570","CVE-2012-1856","CVE-2014-4114","CVE-2017-0199","CVE-2017-11882","CVE-2015-1641"]', '2017-05-31', '2026-07-31', strftime('%Y-%m-%dT%H:%M:%SZ', 'now'));
